IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wica-liability`

-- Work Injury Compensation Act 2019, liability, from the employee's seat -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_work-injury-compensation-act-2019_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a fall at my workstation` MEANS `My accident` WITH
    `I work under a contract of service with the employer` IS TRUE
    `my Third Schedule class` IS `none of the Third Schedule classes`
    `the contract of service was illegal when the accident happened` IS FALSE
    `the Commissioner or the court deals with my case as if the contract were valid` IS FALSE
    `I suffered personal injury caused by an accident` IS TRUE
    `the accident happened in the course of my employment` IS TRUE
    `there is evidence that the accident did not arise out of my employment` IS FALSE
    `the accident happened outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `I am ordinarily resident in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `I am employed by an employer in Singapore and required by my employment to work outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `I was travelling as a passenger to or from my workplace with the employer's express or implied permission` IS FALSE
    `the transport was operated by or for the employer, or under arrangements made with the employer` IS FALSE
    `the transport was operated in the ordinary course of a public transport service` IS FALSE
    `the accident happened in or about my workplace` IS FALSE
    `I was acting on an actual or supposed emergency at the workplace to rescue or protect a person, or to save property` IS FALSE
    `I was acting against a law, a regulation or my employer's orders, or without instructions` IS FALSE
    `the accident would have arisen out of and in the course of my employment had I not been so acting` IS FALSE
    `the act was done for the purposes of and in connection with the employer's trade or business` IS FALSE
    `it is proven my injury is directly attributable to my being under the influence of alcohol or a drug` IS FALSE
    `I injured myself deliberately, or deliberately aggravated an accidental injury` IS FALSE
    `I was injured in a fight or an assault` IS FALSE
    `I assaulted nobody, or only in private defence under Penal Code sections 97 to 106A` IS FALSE
    `I was breaking up or preventing the fight, or safeguarding life or property, or maintaining law and order` IS FALSE
    `I was doing so under my employer's instruction or with its express or implied consent` IS FALSE

