`a subcontractor's worker hurt on the main contractor's site, directed` MEANS `My principal facts` WITH
    `I am employed by a contractor in executing work for the principal` IS TRUE
    `the principal contracted in the course of or for the purpose of its trade or business` IS TRUE
    `the contract was for executing the principal's work or supplying labour for it` IS TRUE
    `the accident happened where the principal undertook the work, or under its control or management` IS TRUE
    `the Commissioner has directed the principal under section 13(1)` IS TRUE

