§ `ss 3, 7, 8 and 9 -- Must my employer pay me compensation`

#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a fall at my workstation`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an injury at home on my day off`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an injury at work shown not to arise out of my work`
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a crash in the company shuttle to work`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a crash on the public bus to work, on an employer-arranged ticket`
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a fall running to a fire alarm that was false`
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an injury while working a machine against orders, for the business`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an injury while using the employer's machine against orders, for myself`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a fall at work proven due to drink`
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an assault at work in which I struck nobody`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a fight at work that I joined`
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a fight at work that I broke up on my supervisor's instruction`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `a fight at work that I broke up on my own initiative`
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an accident on a posting abroad`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an accident in private homes as a domestic worker`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an accident under an illegal contract the Commissioner does not save`
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay me compensation` `an accident under an illegal contract the Commissioner treats as valid`

§ `ss 10 and 12 -- Is my disease compensable as a work injury`

#ASSERT `Is my disease compensable as a work injury` `a listed disease contracted in my listed occupation`
#ASSERT `Is my disease compensable as a work injury` `an unlisted disease from a work solvent, in 2020`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my disease compensable as a work injury` `an unlisted disease from workplace noise`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my disease compensable as a work injury` `an unlisted solvent disease whose incapacity began two years after exposure ended`
#ASSERT `Is my disease compensable as a work injury` `a death from that solvent disease after compensable incapacity`
#ASSERT `Is my disease compensable as a work injury` `an infection of a wound from a work accident`

§ `s 13 -- Can the principal be made to pay me`

#ASSERT `Can the principal be made to pay me` `a subcontractor's worker hurt on the main contractor's site, directed` EQUALS `yes: the Commissioner has directed the principal to pay me, on my earnings under the contractor`
#ASSERT `Can the principal be made to pay me` `a subcontractor's worker hurt on the main contractor's site, no direction yet` EQUALS `only if the Commissioner directs the principal to pay me`
#ASSERT `Can the principal be made to pay me` `a subcontractor's worker hurt at the subcontractor's own yard` EQUALS `no: section 13 does not reach the principal`

§ `s 23(1)`

#ASSERT `Is my agreement giving up compensation void` TRUE FALSE

§ `ss 24 and 25(4)`

#ASSERT `Must my employer insure against its liability to me` FALSE

#ASSERT `What is the most my employer can be fined for deducting the insurance cost from my pay` FALSE EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `What is the most my employer can be fined for deducting the insurance cost from my pay` TRUE EQUALS 10000

§ `s 35(5) to (7) -- Is my claim deemed withdrawn`

#ASSERT NOT `Is my claim deemed withdrawn` `I told my supervisor the next day`
#ASSERT `Is my claim deemed withdrawn` `I told nobody for two years`
#ASSERT `Is my claim deemed withdrawn` `a later period after a delay caused by my suing for damages`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my claim deemed withdrawn` `a later period after a delay abroad`

§ `s 63(1)`

#ASSERT `Have I lost my right to compensation by suing my employer` TRUE FALSE

§ `s 34B(a) -- the platform worker's map, read against the headings`

#ASSERT `Which section applies to me as a platform worker in place of this one` `section 7` EQUALS "34D"
#ASSERT `Which section applies to me as a platform worker in place of this one` `section 8` EQUALS "34F"

